  "notes": [
    "96 selfplay games plus 177 certified-loss cleanup positions, preserving parent-family validation splits.",
    "Candidate A development 7/24, B 13/24; development reused for selection and is not independent.",
    "Candidate C selects epoch 0; all parameters and ONNX equal baseline. Its redundant partial development match was stopped and excluded.",
    "B final 19/48, no caps; predeclared 30/48 guard failed. Deployed baseline retained.",
    "Stratified bootstrap over 24 colour-swapped opening pairs: descriptive 95% score-rate interval 27.1% to 52.1%.",
    "Policy sharpening, confidence gate, baseline KL anchor, balanced sampling, device tensor cache, cosine learning rate and EMA; no architecture/inference change.",
    "Stage A/B patches pin historical training code; final source patch includes value-only and candidate-browser validation.",
    "Log files are archived as .txt to avoid the repository .log ignore pattern."
  ],
